%%begintext align
%% Honour to the presence .| Honour to your own :|
%% ##
%%   The two first men hands, and two first we. hands, and fall back
%%   from each other, men and we. open, close again, and change
%%   places each with his own .| Fall back again, open, close, and 
%%   places as before :|
%%endtext
%%sep 1 1 300
%%begintext align
%% First man lead his wo. down half way, and honour to her. Lead her to the bottom and honour to her :|
%% ##
%%   Then take hands with the last man, his wo. taking hands with
%%   the last wo. fall back from each other, open, close, and change
%%   places as before, the four uppermost doing the like at the same
%%   time .| That again as at the first :|
%%endtext
%%sep 1 1 300
%%begintext align
%% Second man lead down his wo. as before :|
%% ##
%%   That as before, the rest following in order.
%% [DMDfD]
%%endtext
